        <mxCell id="note" value="Return path: the handler response travels back through the base stack, rate_limit_audit, rbac_check, entra_auth and classifier_gateway before audit_appender records the final outcome. Unprotected paths bypass rbac_check entirely. The spec-035 stack is registered only when AMA_ENABLE_PRODUCTION_AUTH=1." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
